  "description": "Time travel is the bread and butter of romance fantasy novels, but the reader who wakes up as Liberata has had enough after the first 19 times. Sure, she's the villainess of \"The Highs and Lows of Leonie's Life,\" but she keeps getting killed even when she's not trying to be evil! Not expecting anything to change in her 20th life, Liberata gets blackout drunk at a party... only to wake up next to the novel's male lead, Archduke Gerlach Cygnus! And the more Gerlach falls for Liberata after their one-night stand, the more the world around them starts falling apart... \n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
